{"body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln-lockup-semibold-ink.svg\" alt=\"kiln\" width=\"104\" height=\"35\"></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"/#local\">Vision</a><a href=\"/#hardware\">Hardware</a><a href=\"/#workflow\">KilnOS</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><button class=\"nav-contact enquiry-open\">Contact</button></nav><button class=\"header-cta register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><button class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><span class=\"menu-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></header>\n<nav class=\"mobile-menu\" id=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Main menu\" hidden><div class=\"menu-links\"><a href=\"/#local\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Vision<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span></a><a href=\"/#hardware\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Hardware<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span></a><a href=\"/#workflow\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>KilnOS<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span></a><a href=\"/about\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>About<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span></a><button class=\"menu-contact enquiry-open\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Contact<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">05</span></button></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">Explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></nav>\n<main id=\"main\"><section class=\"section hardware-intro\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">The Kiln collection</span><span class=\"meta\">One idea. Three scales.</span></div><h1>Find your<br><span>Kiln.</span></h1><p class=\"lead\">Private compute, at your scale.</p><p>Explore the hardware and find your scale. Register interest for product news and launch details.</p></section><section class=\"hardware-collection\" aria-label=\"Choose your Kiln\"><a class=\"hardware-card tone-yellow\" href=\"/products/one\"><span class=\"meta\">Target hardware price</span><h2>One</h2><img src=\"/assets/one-interior-yellow-cutout.webp\" alt=\"Kiln One hardware concept\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"><p>A dedicated workstation for local AI and focused creative work.</p><div class=\"card-price\"><strong>£17,000</strong></div><span class=\"text-link\">Explore One <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></a><a class=\"hardware-card tone-red\" href=\"/products/atelier\"><span class=\"meta\">Configuration-led pricing</span><h2>Atelier</h2><img src=\"/assets/atelier-interior-red-cutout.webp\" alt=\"Kiln Atelier hardware concept\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"><p>For teams running more demanding model and media workflows on shared local hardware.</p><div class=\"card-price\"><strong>Price to be confirmed</strong></div><span class=\"text-link\">Explore Atelier <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></a><a class=\"hardware-card tone-blue\" href=\"/products/rack\"><span class=\"meta\">Configuration-led pricing</span><h2>Atelier Rack</h2><img src=\"/assets/atelier-rack-frame-blue-cutout.webp\" alt=\"Kiln Atelier Rack hardware concept\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"><p>For a growing studio planning a shared local compute resource across several teams.</p><div class=\"card-price\"><strong>Price to be confirmed</strong></div><span class=\"text-link\">Explore Atelier Rack <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></a></section><section class=\"section hardware-note\"><h2>Stay close.<br>See what’s next.</h2><p>Register interest in the system that fits your work. We’ll share product news and launch details as Kiln takes shape. No payment or commitment.</p><button class=\"action primary register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></section></main>\n<footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><a href=\"/#top\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln-lockup-semibold-paper.svg\" width=\"135\" height=\"46\" alt=\"kiln\"></a><p>Independent thinking.<br>Local compute.</p><nav aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"/about\">About Kiln</a><a href=\"/#hardware\">The hardware</a><a href=\"/#questions\">Questions</a><a href=\"/#privacy\">Our privacy direction</a><a href=\"/privacy\">Website privacy</a><button class=\"footer-contact enquiry-open\">Contact us ↗</button></nav></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© Kiln 2026 / Porto Labs</span><span>Hardware and software in development.</span><a href=\"/#top\">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer>\n<button class=\"mobile-dock register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n<dialog id=\"register-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"register-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close registration\">×</button><span class=\"meta\">Stay close to Kiln</span><h2 id=\"register-title\">Be first<br>to know.</h2><p>Product news, launch details and a closer look at private, local compute.</p><form action=\"https://formspree.io/f/xjgepgbg\" method=\"POST\" class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"interest\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-email\">Email address</label><input id=\"register-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-product\">What brings you to Kiln? <span>(optional)</span></label><select id=\"register-product\" name=\"product\"><option>Still exploring</option><option>Kiln One</option><option>Kiln Atelier</option><option>Kiln Atelier Rack</option><option>Media</option><option>Legal</option><option>Investor interest</option></select></div><label class=\"consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" required><span>Email me Kiln product and launch updates. I can unsubscribe at any time.</span></label><div class=\"form-trap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>Leave this empty<input name=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></div><p class=\"form-note\">Your details go to the Kiln team through Formspree. <a href=\"/privacy\">How we use your information</a></p><p class=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p><button class=\"action primary\" type=\"submit\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></form><div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" hidden><h3>You’re on the list.</h3><p>Your interest has been registered. We’ll be in touch as Kiln takes shape.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">Back to Kiln <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></dialog>\n\n<dialog id=\"enquiry-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"enquiry-title\" aria-describedby=\"contact-intro\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close contact\">×</button><h2 id=\"enquiry-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Let’s talk.</h2><p class=\"contact-intro\" id=\"contact-intro\">What are you working on?</p><form class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"contact\"><input id=\"enquiry-interest\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"reason\" value=\"General question\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"work-email\">Your email</label><input id=\"work-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"workflow-message\">Your message</label><textarea id=\"workflow-message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"3000\" placeholder=\"A project, a question, an idea…\" required></textarea></div><div class=\"form-trap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>Leave this empty<input name=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></div><p class=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p><button class=\"action primary contact-send\" type=\"submit\"><span data-submit-label>Send message</span><span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><p class=\"form-note\">Just a reply. No mailing list. <a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a></p></form><div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" hidden><h3>Thanks for the hello.</h3><p>We’ve received your message.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">Back to Kiln <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div><div class=\"contact-booking\"><span>Prefer a conversation?</span><a href=\"/book/\">Book a call <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></dialog>\n<dialog id=\"compare-dialog\" class=\"compare-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"compare-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close comparison\">×</button><span class=\"meta\">Hardware / Compare</span><h2 id=\"compare-title\">Find your fit.</h2><p>Proposed configurations. In development.</p><div class=\"compare-grid\"><article class=\"compare-item\"><h3>Kiln One</h3><strong>£17,000</strong><p class=\"fine\">Target hardware price</p><dl><dt>Graphics</dt><dd>RTX PRO 5000 / 72 GB per GPU</dd><dt>GPU capacity</dt><dd>1 GPU, expandable up to 2</dd><dt>System memory / Storage</dt><dd>128 GB / 4 TB</dd><dt>Dimensions / W × H × D</dt><dd>250 × 450 × 460 mm</dd></dl></article><article class=\"compare-item\"><h3>Kiln Atelier</h3><strong>Let’s talk</strong><p class=\"fine\">Configuration and pricing to be confirmed</p><dl><dt>Graphics</dt><dd>RTX PRO 6000 Max-Q / 96 GB per GPU</dd><dt>GPU capacity</dt><dd>2 GPUs, expandable up to 4</dd><dt>System memory / Storage</dt><dd>512 GB ECC / 8 TB</dd><dt>Dimensions / W × H × D</dt><dd>520 × 220 × 600 mm</dd></dl></article></div><p class=\"fine\">Atelier Rack combines four Ateliers in a modular enclosure. All figures are engineering targets, subject to validation. GPU memory is per card; multiple cards do not automatically form one memory pool. Renders show expanded component concepts.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">Back to the hardware <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></dialog>\n", "title": "The hardware — Kiln", "description": "Find your Kiln. Explore Kiln One, Atelier and Atelier Rack, and register your interest.", "path": "/hardware/"}
